WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.050 --> 00:00:06.899
Unfortunately, I know very little about Dubnium,
I am not sure anybody knows much about it,

00:00:06.899 --> 00:00:17.260
but it is named after the Russian atomic research
establishment, Dubna. In these artificial

00:00:17.260 --> 00:00:24.880
elements, the elements are either named after
somebody who is famous like Rutherford for

00:00:24.880 --> 00:00:30.880
Rutherfordium or in the place where an element
was first discovered, but often where there

00:00:30.880 --> 00:00:37.719
is argument about who discovered the element
first, then it is more equitable to name it

00:00:37.719 --> 00:00:39.270
after scientists.

